<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.600 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.600 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.6500 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Monday after 75.5000 on Friday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Feb 17		  Feb 14</p>
<p> High			     75.6000		 75.4000</p>
<p> Low				75.7900		 75.8000</p>
<p> Open			     75.7400		 75.4000</p>
<p> Close			    75.6500		 75.5000</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)		  2.420		   9.605</p>
<p> TENGE PER MARK		 Feb 17		  Feb 12</p>
<p> High			     44.9000		 45.1600</p>
